WEBVTT

00:10:30.912 --> 00:10:33.704
He'd just had surgery
on his eyes, he said.

00:10:33.746 --> 00:10:35.954
He had problems with his side
and his legs too,

00:10:35.954 --> 00:10:38.371
and, oh, he'd lost his teeth in the crash.

00:10:38.371 --> 00:10:40.371
Did I wish to see him remove them?

00:10:41.537 --> 00:10:43.912
Abed then rose and turned on the TV

00:10:43.912 --> 00:10:46.746
so that I wouldn't be alone
when he left the room,

00:10:46.746 --> 00:10:49.079
and returned with Polaroids of the crash

00:10:49.121 --> 00:10:50.787
and his old driver's license.

00:10:52.246 --> 00:10:54.121
"I was handsome," he said.

00:10:55.412 --> 00:10:57.537
We looked down at his laminated mug.

00:10:57.537 --> 00:11:00.537
Abed had been less handsome
than substantial,